<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian 13-week T-note yields 6.357 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian 13-week T-note yields 6.357 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of Australia said the result of this week's T-note tender was as follows:</p>
<p> 13-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS400 million   6.357	 6.33-6.37   6.365</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up A$200 million, pct allotted at top 80)</p>
<p> 5-week  -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS500 million   6.401	 6.38-6.41   6.408</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up A$300 million, pct allotted at top 20)</p>
<p> 26-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS400 million   6.305	 6.30-6.31   6.339</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up A$300 million, pct allotted at top 58)</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
